                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h2>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Apex University of Technology Examination Fee Guidelines</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold">1. Fee Payment Guidelines</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">All online examination fees paid through the portal are processed via secure payment banking channels. A digital payment receipt with unique transaction ID is generated upon successful debit.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. Duplicate or Erroneous Transactions</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">In the event of a duplicate transaction where the student's bank account has been debited more than once for the same examination form, the excess amount will be refunded to the originating account within 7 to 10 working days upon verification by the Finance Division.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Cancellation &amp; Non-Refundable Charges</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">Examination fees once paid are generally non-refundable after the examination form has been approved by the institution and hall tickets have been generated, except under extenuating medical circumstances approved by the University Academic Council.</p>

                <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Payment Support Contact</h5>
                <p class="text-secondary small">
                    For all payment inquiries, transaction status reconciliation, or chargeback queries, contact our dedicated Payment Helpline at <a href="tel:8709878369">8709878369</a> or email <a href="mailto:adarshraj112008@gmail.com">adarshraj112008@gmail.com</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
